Report: Each team is required to submit an electronic report before the end of the design period,  with a recommended maximum of ten (10) pages, excluding appendices. The report must detail  the team's proposed solution to the balance rehabilitation challenge and will be made available to  the judges before each team's presentation. 
The report must include, but is not limited to: 
